Anubias barteri var. coffeef[olia] is a low[ cultivar] of Anubias barteri[. Its] characteristic is[ that] the[ leaves] arch considerably between the leaf ribs,[ and] the new[ leaves] are red-brown. The color combination and leaf shape make it an attractive variety in both large and small aquariums.[ It] flowers frequently under water[ but does not] produce seeds.
Anubias bar[teri] var. coffeef[olia] is not eaten by herbivorous fish.
